      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BILLYS TIGER KHAN (2) hasn't raced for 15 months but closed off last campaign in good form, scoring at his last appearance at Kilmore. Readied with a trial win and has won when fresh before. Has the benefit of a good draw so could pick up where he left off. THINKFAST RUNFAST (1) is another back from a lengthy layoff, last seen when fourth at Melton in August last year. Won his only attempt at this circuit and distance and was readied with a trial. Gets the ace draw so look for a good return. EXOTIC CHESTER (6) draws wider than when he resumed with a second a fortnight ago but he won his lone second-up attempt and it came at this circuit and distance so history could repeat. JUST PEDRO (4) has been solid from the second line of late. Back on the front row and is a two-time winner at this circuit and distance.",
